{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If object is visible, take it, check it, move. If not, search. Avoid obstacles. Do specific task. list of available nodes: <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <SubTree ID = CheckObject    /> <Action ID = MoveToDestination    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectApproached    /> <Action ID = SearchForObject    /> <Condition ID = IsPathBlocked    /> <Action ID = BackUp    /> <Action ID = DoSpecificTask    />",
